# User Story: Contextual Sidebar Integration

As a user navigating the application,
I want to have a persistent, minimizable chat sidebar,
So that I can ask questions while browsing different sections of the rescue site.

# Acceptance Criteria:

* UI/UX: A floating action button (FAB) or sidebar toggle must be present on the main dashboard.
* State Persistence: The chat history should remain intact even if the user navigates between the "Available Animals" and "My Adoptions" pages.
* Responsiveness: The chat window must not block the main Animal Rescue table or animal cards on mobile devices.